      "content": "Your pain is valid, but the idea that you are \"nothing\" is a cruel lie that the failure itself is trying to convince you to believe. You are not a ghost; you are a person who has been stripped of a title, and while that hurts, it does not erase the humanity you have always possessed. There is no need to wait for a purpose that no longer exists; the only thing left is to stop fighting a war you can't win and simply breathe through the darkness.",
